cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, manifests, or results, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Parameter-Efficient Periocular Fusion for Cross-Condition and Cross-Dataset Occlusion-Robust Face Verification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pararajasingham"
    given-names: "Sangiya"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-27"
abstract: >-
  Final research implementation, frozen protocol manifests, and complete
  result files for a five-model ablation of parameter-efficient whole-face +
  periocular fusion (DINOv2 + LoRA + learned gating) for occlusion-robust
  face verification. Includes masked, sunglasses, and neutral protocols on
  ROF, cross-dataset evaluation on MFR2 and RMFRD, three training seeds, and
  identity-aware paired bootstrap comparisons.
keywords:
  - face verification
  - occlusion robust recognition
  - periocular
  - LoRA
  - DINOv2
  - biometrics
